(text "R0: Standard IBM-PC 34-pin FDD rear interface; cable twist handled by firmware selection.\n5V inputs use 5.5V-tolerant LVC245 at 3.3V. Outputs are LS06 open collector; ASSERT=1 pulls cable LOW.\nMedia J3 is an internal carrier boundary, NOT the seven moving contacts. Isolation and safe eject are unfinished.\nPico is a factory-assembled SMD module plugged into TH sockets. Carrier assembly is through-hole.\nLegacy floppy encoding/track streaming and native dock protocol require new firmware; no compatibility claim." (at 30 255 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 0f1d4d51-290e-4d8b-8392-1ffca4297f23))(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))